                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Staggered in time and space."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1f18294b-88ff-4016-8e42-875c0006b1cd",
                                                "sense_id": "290c80b0-e081-3efe-bcd7-dd08e9b87446",
                                                "text": "on a rolling basis"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ca59273-8bcb-44d9-b9c6-2beeb96f373c",
                                                "sense_id": "290c80b0-e081-3efe-bcd7-dd08e9b87446",
                                                "text": "a 90-day rolling business plan"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "56cc00d6-0e96-4bee-a5ce-95b558dfe25a",
                                                "sense_id": "290c80b0-e081-3efe-bcd7-dd08e9b87446",
                                                "text": "rolling blackouts or brownouts"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4560426d-ac32-3ec0-b1ac-9411c86f0b65",
                                        "entry_id": "16d598d3-24ee-38f8-bf59-4810869bb803",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Moving by turning over and over about an axis."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a43d3732-ab60-4f59-9779-2c41b41438cd",
                                                "sense_id": "4560426d-ac32-3ec0-b1ac-9411c86f0b65",
                                                "text": "The rolling mist came down and hid the land: / And never home came she."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1611d2e9-192d-36c7-bbc6-e05db40b02a6",
                                        "entry_id": "16d598d3-24ee-38f8-bf59-4810869bb803",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Extending in gentle undulations (of the landscape)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f21b27fc-b9ee-4c1f-b39a-0dccb2915df7",
                                                "sense_id": "1611d2e9-192d-36c7-bbc6-e05db40b02a6",
                                                "text": "From Blackwater there is a more or less level run through gently rolling farmlands and downs to Merstone, with its island platform and passing loop."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c6335236-f84a-4c6a-b79e-ae9ffadf5554",
                                                "sense_id": "1611d2e9-192d-36c7-bbc6-e05db40b02a6",
                                                "text": "2002, Russell Allen & Michael Romeo, \"Part II - Journey to Ithaca\" of \"The Odyssey\", \"Incantations of the Apprentice\", on Symphony X, The Odyssey.\nI miss the rolling hills of Ithaca"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "61c35b53-1d95-3e5b-a79f-d3230a443d9b",
                                        "entry_id": "16d598d3-24ee-38f8-bf59-4810869bb803",
